                                          "width": "fill_container",
                                          "height": 126,
                                          "content": "AnyList costs $10 a YEAR. Ten dollars. KitchenOwl and Mealie are lovely, but valuing your setup evening at literally any hourly rate puts break-even past 2030. The purest example of the cheap-subscription pattern on the whole scoreboard.",
