                                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width-height",
                                          "width": "fill_container",
                                          "height": 126,
                                          "content": "Backrest + restic is excellent software, but 'offsite' means renting storage anyway — and your backup of last resort should not depend on a server you also administer. The math never breaks even; the failure mode is losing everything twice.",
