                                          "fill": "#9aa0ab",
                                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width-height",
                                          "width": "fill_container",
                                          "height": 147,
                                          "content": "$7/mo for 100GB with sync apps and zero ops. Seafile and Nextcloud replace the software easily — then you're paying for storage, backups and bandwidth anyway, arriving at roughly the same money with pager duty included. Dropbox got a KINDA at $11.99; Box at $7 doesn't clear the bar.",
