                                          "width": "fill_container",
                                          "height": 126,
                                          "content": "$6.17/mo for unlimited hosting plus the last real photo community. Piwigo and Immich store photos superbly (Immich already earned an ownership-driven NO here against Google One) — but Flickr Pro is community + hosting, and half of that doesn't self-host.",
