                                          "width": "fill_container",
                                          "height": 105,
                                          "content": "Immich is the best software in this index and $24/yr is the worst reason to run it. A photos server wants real RAM, real storage and real backups — run Immich for ownership and privacy, not to save two dollars a month.",
