                                        {
                                          "type": "text",
                                          "id": "O3VKA",
                                          "name": "The docs and drive parts self-host fine ",
                                          "context": "p",
                                          "fill": "#9aa0ab",
                                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width-height",
                                          "width": "fill_container",
                                          "height": 147,
                                          "content": "The docs and drive parts self-host fine (OnlyOffice, Nextcloud — both on this scoreboard). The email part is the trap: self-hosted SMTP in 2026 is a deliverability hobby where you debug why Gmail silently spam-folders your invoices. Email is the one workload we tell everyone to keep paying for.",
