                                          "fill": "#9aa0ab",
                                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width-height",
                                          "width": "fill_container",
                                          "height": 126,
                                          "content": "It's one page of links. You don't need to self-host an app for that — you need 40 lines of HTML on any static host, free. LinkStack exists and works; recommending a PHP container to replace a static page is how self-hosting gets its reputation.",
