                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "Vaultwarden is the strongest self-hosted alternative we have tested in any category — a faithful, Bitwarden-compatible server that runs comfortably on hardware you already own. It is not the server that fails this rating.",
