                          "fill": "$text-2",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "It is the risk premium. A password manager is the one service where downtime is not an inconvenience but a lockout, and where a botched restore is unrecoverable. We price that at 40% — the highest premium in the model — which puts the all-in run rate at $3.40 against a $2.99 subscription. At that price there is simply no room to lose.",
