                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "Scaled to blast radius. Nought where a failure costs you an irritating afternoon; forty where it means a lockout, lost originals, or an explanation owed to somebody else. It prices the fact that you are the entire support rota, and it hides how differently people feel about that.",
