              "name": "Colophon Columns",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "gap": 32,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "BtuBX",
                  "name": "PUBLISHED BY",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "stroke": "$border",
                  "strokeWidth": {
                    "top": 1
                  },
                  "layout": "vertical",
                  "gap": 11,
                  "padding": [
                    14,
                    0,
                    0,
                    0
                  ],
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "yjtnw",
                      "name": "Label",
                      "fill": "$text-1",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "PUBLISHED BY",
                      "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
                      "fontSize": 10,
                      "fontWeight": "700",
                      "letterSpacing": 1.3
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "u08UMK",
                      "name": "Body",
                      "fill": "$text-2",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "The Disclosure Desk — two editors and one always-on mini PC, registered in Rotterdam. Funded by 1,840 readers at $3 a month, which is printed here because it is the only money involved. No investors, no affiliate links, no advertising, no sponsored panels.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.65,
                      "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                      "fontSize": 12.5,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "K6mIne",
                  "name": "LICENCE",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "stroke": "$border",
                  "strokeWidth": {
                    "top": 1
                  },
                  "layout": "vertical",
                  "gap": 11,
                  "padding": [
                    14,
                    0,
                    0,
                    0
                  ],
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "n8MWc0",
                      "name": "Label",
                      "fill": "$text-1",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "LICENCE",
                      "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
                      "fontSize": 10,
                      "fontWeight": "700",
                      "letterSpacing": 1.3
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "VlOqD",
                      "name": "Body",
                      "fill": "$text-2",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Every figure on every panel is CC BY-SA 4.0. Reprint the labels freely; keep the attribution and the revision date attached to them. The model that computes the panels and the site that prints them are AGPL-3.0 and published in full.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.65,
                      "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                      "fontSize": 12.5,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "zSV4t",
                  "name": "DISCLOSURE",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "stroke": "$border",
                  "strokeWidth": {
                    "top": 1
                  },
                  "layout": "vertical",
                  "gap": 11,
                  "padding": [
                    14,
                    0,
                    0,
                    0
                  ],
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "pAbPK",
                      "name": "Label",
                      "fill": "$text-1",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "DISCLOSURE",
                      "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
                      "fontSize": 10,
                      "fontWeight": "700",
                      "letterSpacing": 1.3
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "aGpLJ",
                      "name": "Body",
                      "fill": "$text-2",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "No vendor has ever paid for a verdict and none ever will. We buy our own hardware, hold no stake in any project on the roll, and accept no review licences or hosting credit. Where a maintainer has bought us a coffee at a conference, the panel says so.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.65,
                      "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                      "fontSize": 12.5,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "MOlWW",
                  "name": "CONTESTING A VERDICT",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "stroke": "$border",
                  "strokeWidth": {
                    "top": 1
                  },
                  "layout": "vertical",
                  "gap": 11,
                  "padding": [
                    14,
                    0,
                    0,
                    0
                  ],
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "C31hdN",
                      "name": "Label",
                      "fill": "$text-1",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "CONTESTING A VERDICT",
                      "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
                      "fontSize": 10,
                      "fontWeight": "700",
                      "letterSpacing": 1.3
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "BGqsR",
                      "name": "Body",
                      "fill": "$text-2",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "A vendor who believes a panel is wrong submits their own figures against the same four assumptions. We recompute in public and print the original panel, the submission and the result side by side, whichever way it lands. Median turnaround fourteen days. Nine filed to date: five upheld, two corrected, two withdrawn.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.65,
                      "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                      "fontSize": 12.5,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "zPUKa",
                      "name": "Address",
